msgctxt "4772_Investigation Report 3"
msgid "Someone claiming to be named GG entered the club and avoided contact with other customers, to the point of suspicion. Possible rendezvous attempt. Must investigate the reason behind this."
msgstr "Alguien que alega llamarse GG entro al club y evito contacto con\notros clientes, hasta el punto de levantar sospechas. Posible\npunto de encuentro. Se debe investigar el motivo de esto."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4784_Investigation Report 4"
msgid "Investigation report by Tanimura.\\r\n\\r\nA well-known and feared assassin was spotted in Kamurocho. Possibility that GG is accompanied by members of his organization."
msgstr "Informe de investigación de Tanimura.\\r\n\\r\nSe avistó a un conocido asesino en Kamurocho. Hay posibilidad de que GG esté acompañado por miembros de su organización."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=5
#. y4:msg_phrase=9
#. y4:msg_location=T5.P9
#. y4:msg_speaker=Investigation Report 5
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=11
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Check Investigation
msgctxt "4796_Investigation Report 5"
msgid "Information suggests that a person thought to be GG enters a multi-tenant building on Pink Street every night. Need proof that GG is our man to get a warrant. Must stake out the building to collect evidence."
msgstr "La información sugiere que una persona la cual se cree es GG entra a un edificio en la calle Pink cada noche. Necesitamos pruebas para obtener una orden de arresto. Debemos vigilar aquel edificio para recopilar evidencia."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=5
#. y4:msg_phrase=10
#. y4:msg_location=T5.P10
#. y4:msg_speaker=Investigation Report 6
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=12
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Check Investigation
msgctxt "4808_Investigation Report 6"
msgid "Garcia, the detective making inquiries at the embassy, has disappeared. The embassy says he promptly left after submitting documents. Must ascertain GG's whereabouts as soon as possible."
msgstr "Garcia, el detective enviado a la embajada, ha desaparecido. La embajada informó que se fue al entregar documentos. Debemos averiguar donde se esconde GG lo antes posible."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4820_Investigation Report 7"
msgid "Investigation report by Tanimura.\\r\n\\r\nArrested a weapons trader who said he got an order in from someone named GG. The order included a helicopter. Its intended purpose is unknown."
msgstr "Informe de investigación de Tanimura.\\r\n\\r\nArrestamos a un traficante de armas que alega haber recibido un pedido de alguien llamado GG. El pedido incluía un helicóptero. Su propósito es desconocido."

#. y4:line_status=translated
