msgctxt "4880_Tanimura"
msgid "[Some foreigners I arrested for possession of firearms said they were afraid of some assassin trained by GG and had to protect themselves.]"
msgstr "[Arreste a unos extranjeros por posesión de armas y dijeron que\nle temían a un asesino entrenado por GG y por eso tenían que\nprotegerse.]"

#. y4:line_status=translated
