#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Check Investigation
msgctxt "4964_Nair"
msgid "[So he brought backup. I don't know how many we'll have to face, but we need to stay on our toes from now on.]"
msgstr "[Así que trajo refuerzos. No sé a cuantos tendremos que hacerles\nfrente, pero debemos estar alertas de ahora en adelante.]"

